  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Scope, privacy & attribution",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "local-loki"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 16,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Server Watch \u2014 observed inbound packet flows, not an attack detector.** Capture is on the physical public interface before firewall verdicts; `decision=unknown` means allowed/blocked is not inferred. UDP's first observed packet may be a reply. Retransmits/repeated 5-tuples collapse for 30 seconds, so counts are emitted observations, not packet totals or unique initiators.\n\nOnly this dedicated collector stream is read; payloads are not collected. IPs remain event fields (never Loki labels). Geographic points are approximate IP geolocation, not exact people; unmapped/private/unknown locations remain in totals and feed, omitted from map. Local DB-IP Lite city/ASN data: [DB-IP Lite](https://db-ip.com/db/download/ip-to-city-lite) \u2014 [CC BY 4.0](https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/). Lookup is local; source IPs are not sent to online lookup services. For firewall/auth verdicts see [Host Security (UFW / SSH / Fail2Ban)](/d/host-security/host-security)."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Observed flows (not attacks)",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "local-loki"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 16,
        "y": 0
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(count_over_time({job=\"security-watch\"} | json | kind=\"attempt\" | src_ip=~`${source_ip:raw}` | protocol=~\"${protocol:regex}\" [$__range]))",
          "queryType": "instant"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto"
      }
    },
